        StaticBook("stabbings", "DukeofZufenhaus", "TIMES I HAVE BEEN STABBED OR ATTACKED\n\n\n         -by sentinel\n\n1 \nTHAT ONE TIME I GOT ROBBED AND I RAN FROM PVP BECAUSE IM A WEENIE\n\n2\nTHAT SECOND TIME I GOT ROBBED AND THE ORC TOOK THE GOO BALLS AND STUCK IT IN HIS NOSE\n\n3\nTHAT TIME I GOT ATTACKED BY A GHOUL\n\n4\nTHAT TIME I GOT ATTACKED IN CALIPHATE BY 20 PEOPLE AT ONCE FOR NO REASON\n\n5\nTHAT ONE TIME THE HIGH ELVES KILLED ME BECAUSE IM AN IDIOT\n\n6 \nTHAT ONE TIME THAT ELF KILLED ME BECAUSE I WOULDN'T MARRY HIM\n\n7\nTHAT TIME I BROKE INTO DARKWOOD\nAND EVERYONE GOT SALTY\n\n8 \nTHAT TIME I GOT PVPED FOR EXISTING IN FELSEN\n\n9\nTHAT ONE TIME I WAS CAPTURED AND TORTURED FOR HOURS THEN THEY TRIED TO LYNCH ME\n\n10 \nTHAT ONE TIME I GOT ROBBED THROUGH BAD RP THAN MADE THEM KILL ME SO I COULD LEAVE\n\n11\nTHAT ONE TIME I PISSED VULTHUR OFF\n\n12 \nTHAT ONE TIME I WAS TRYING TO LEAVE THE DWARVEN CAPITOL AND GOT ATTACKED\n\n13  \nTHAT TIME I GOT ROBBED BY A GUY WITH A FACE ON HIS HEAD\n\n14\nTHAT ONE TIME I WENT BONKERS AND SAHAR SUPLEXED ME WHILE I WAS BITTING ZAF'S HAND", ""),
        StaticBook("Conversation", "§bAlan Marlsbush", "Hello, I'm Curuon, the elf who lives inf front of this place. I was wondering if I can have some informations about you guild. I really care about nature and a usually ranger groups and nature works well together. Just put an answer on this book and\n\ndeliver it in the mailbox (chest for strings) in front of my house. (Also I sent a message on the forum to you Eulb). §0\n§0\n§0-Curuon-§0\n§0\n§0*the book is left blank for an answer*\n\nMr. Curuon§0\n§0\n§0We at the Rangers' Guild are delighted to hear that others are interested in joining our group.§0\n§0It is proper, however, in such a situation, to alert you as to the nature of our group. We are currently in the process of raising\n\nfunds to purchase a charter and settle our own land, for which the Guild would eventually become a sort of defence force. We intend to settle away from Sutica, the nation which has so graciously granted us a base of operations, in order to avoid quarrel\n\nwith our hosts.§0\n§0If you are still interested, we are in need of all sorts of artisans - smiths, farmers, fishermen, masons, woodworkers, and others.§0\n§0Do note that if you joined the Guild, you would not be compensated monetarily, but\n\nrather with housing and food, and perhaps basic weaponry once we get that far. Of course, this compensation would likely depend on whether you moved with us - we would need someone to maintain the Guild House in Sutica.§0\n§0To conclude, if you\n\nwish to join the Guild, it would likely require you to move far from here and help settle new lands, though some small membership would probably stay behind to maintain relations with Sutica.§0\n§0Joining the Guild would require an interview with our lord.\n\nPlease give us a time when you are available ((We are in EST.", ""),
        StaticBook("College Ledger", "§bGallidron Elindrow", "-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-College Recruitment Ledger§0\n§0-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-Requirements:§0\n§0Must have a very basic knowledge of the subject, Ex. They have to know what alchemy is to join alchemy.§0\n§0Must be physically capable to do tasks and assignments.\n\n{\"text\":\"\"}\n\n{\"text\":\"\"}\n\n{\"text\":\"\"}\n\n-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-Current Staff Manifest -=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-Hugo Alvertyne - Dean§0\n§0<Emptey Slot> - Vice-Dean§0\n§0<Emptey Slot> - Recruiter§0\n§0Archipeligo - Alchemy Head Professor§0\n§0<Emptey Slot> - Head Magic Professor§0\n§0TheLemonHead-Head Combat Professor\n\n{\"text\":\"\"}\n\n{\"text\":\"\"}\n\n{\"text\":\"\"}\n\n{\"text\":\"\"}\n\n-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-Current Student Manifest§0\n§0-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-", ""),
        StaticBook("Torn Page", "§bAncient Dwarf", "[!] This page has been torn out from it's respective  tome.\n\nThe Magi have begun dissapearing. I pray to Khorvad that we find them, else we may be stuck in this accursed place. Their leader, Dwov, is still about. I fear for him, though. His mind has begun to deteriorate for reasons unkown. We've enough supplies to\n\nlast another three weeks.", ""),
        StaticBook("Govt. I.D. [005]", "§bGoseph Joebbelstein", "===Heil Vandaloria===\n\nName: \nAdil ibn Athir\nMCName: kincaid_\n\nPosition: Council Member of Hallowvale.\n\nClearance:\nLevel 5\n\n{\"text\":\"\"}\n\n{\"text\":\"\"}\n\n{\"text\":\"\"}\n\n{\"text\":\"\"}\n\n{\"text\":\"\"}\n\n{\"text\":\"\"}\n\n{\"text\":\"\"}\n\n{\"text\":\"\"}\n\n{\"text\":\"\"}\n\n{\"text\":\"\"}\n\n{\"text\":\"\"}\n\n{\"text\":\"\"}\n\n{\"text\":\"\"}\n\n{\"text\":\"\"}\n\n{\"text\":\"\"}\n\n{\"text\":\"\"}\n\n{\"text\":\"\"}\n\n{\"text\":\"\"}\n\n{\"text\":\"\"}\n\n{\"text\":\"\"}\n\n{\"text\":\"\"}\n\n{\"text\":\"\"}\n\n{\"text\":\"\"}\n\nlol\n\n{\"text\":\"\"}\n\n{\"text\":\"\"}\n\n{\"text\":\"\"}\n\n{\"text\":\"\"}\n\n{\"text\":\"\"}\n\n{\"text\":\"\"}\n\n{\"text\":\"\"}\n\n{\"text\":\"\"}\n\n{\"text\":\"\"}\n\n{\"text\":\"\"}\n\n{\"text\":\"\"}\n\n{\"text\":\"\"}\n\n{\"text\":\"\"}\n\n{\"text\":\"\"}\n\n{\"text\":\"\"}\n\nasdsa", ""),
