        StaticBook("Writable Book", "", "-*-*-*-*-*-*-*-*-*-*-§0\n§0\n§0\n§0\n§0\n§0      Eva's Journal§0\n§0\n§0\n§0\n§0\n§0\n§0\n§0\n§0*-*-*-*-*-*-*-*-*-*-\n\n*On this page would be a very detailed picture of a handsome man from the torso up. Below that would be the body of a spider. Great time and effort is obvious in the drawing*§0\n§0\n§0\n§0Mystery Spider Man§0\n§0\n§0~Eva Nevermore~\n\n*Drawn on this page would be a freaky drawing of what appears to be a ghost. The Ghost would look like a large black robe with blank open eye sockets, it would be reaching out as if to grab you*§0\n§0\n§0Dark Figure§0\n§0\n§0~Eva Nevermore~\n\n*A very detailed drawing of a young High-Elf is on this page. He'd have a scar over his left eye but that does not dull his beauty. He'd have a large smile on his face.*§0\n§0\n§0\n§0Maybe Ewlin§0\n§0\n§0~Eva Nevermore~\n\nA beautiful lady\n\nLarge suit of armor with tiny dark-elf girl holding his hand. Each wearing a flower crown.", ""),
